strong\">Peter</span>: Yeah. We would play until we were too cold to continue. Mom would make a vat of fries for us!</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I've never seen a backyard ice rink."}, {"time": "23000", "image": "engenn6le18ob09re2img02.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Some people worked on one for weeks. It would keep all of us kids outside for hours.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Sounds like it was a clever to keep you busy!</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I haven't skated for a long time. Why not go next week on New Year's Day?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I haven't got any skates.  </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: We can rent them."}, {"time": "37500", "image": "engenn6le18ob09re2img03.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I'll whip up some hot chocolate and treats.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: We used to go to the rink early. It wasn't as crowded.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: When we've finished we can come back here after and reheat leftovers.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: It's a date!"}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}, {"contents": [{"type": "picture", "value": {"coverimg": "engenn6le18ob09re2img01.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn6le18ob09re2aud01", "images": []}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 2, "_data": []}]}]}